# Logs
# 注意必须带前导斜杠：写成 `logs` 会把 src/views/audit/logs/ 这类源码目录
# 一起忽略掉，导致 clone 下来缺文件、构建报 ENOENT
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
.DS_Store
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local

/cypress/videos/
/cypress/screenshots/

